            {
              "id": "545384a4-5383-3d3c-a1ca-f77245abfa8f",
              "name": "\"High Severity Vulnerability in Body-Parser Package Version 1.20.1, Fixed in Version 1.20.3 (CVE-2024-45590)\"",
              "helpUri": "https://www.glog.ai/",
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "The vulnerability in the `body-parser` package version 1.20.1 (CVE-2024-45590) is a high severity security issue. The exact nature of the vulnerability is not specified in the question, but it could be related to improper input validation, buffer overflow, or other common security issues.\n\nThis is a security concern because it could allow an attacker to exploit the vulnerability to perform malicious activities such as executing arbitrary code, causing a denial of service, or accessing sensitive information.\n\n## Mitigation Advice\n\nThe recommended mitigation for this vulnerability is to upgrade the `body-parser` package to version 1.20.3 or later, which includes a fix for the vulnerability. This can be done by updating the package version in your `package.json` file and running `npm install`.\n\n## Source Code Fix Recommendation\n\nChange the `body-parser` version in your `package.json` file:\n\n```json\n\"body-parser\": \"^1.20.3\"\n```\n\nThen run:\n\n```bash\nnpm install\n```\n\n## Dependencies\n\nThe `body-parser` package version 1.20.1 requires the following dependencies:\n\n- bytes: 3.1.2\n- content-type: ~1.0.4\n- debug: 2.6.9\n- depd: 2.0.0\n- destroy: 1.2.0\n- http-errors: 2.0.0\n- iconv-lite: 0.4.24\n- on-finished: 2.4.1\n- qs: 6.11.0\n- raw-body: 2.5.1\n- type-is: ~1.6.18\n- unpipe: 1.0.0\n\n## References\n\n- [OWASP Top Ten](https://owasp.org/www-project-top-ten/)\n- [Common Weakness Enumeration (CWE)](https://cwe.mitre.org/)\n\nPlease note that the exact CWE entry for this vulnerability is not specified in the question. You can search for the appropriate CWE entry based on the nature of the vulnerability."
              },
              "properties": {
                "cwe": [],
                "severity": "HIGH",
                "kind": "FAIL"
              }
