            {
              "id": "f17120ef-4d23-38a2-acec-855a1792ffe6",
              "name": "\"Critical Vulnerability in form-data Package, Versions 4.0.0: Resolved in Versions 2.5.4, 3.0.4, 4.0.4 (CVE-2025-7783)\"",
              "helpUri": "https://www.glog.ai/",
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "## Description\n\nThe `form-data` package versions 4.0.0 has a critical vulnerability (CVE-2025-7783) that could potentially allow an attacker to execute arbitrary code or cause a denial of service (DoS) through a specific function of the package. This vulnerability is a security concern as it could allow an attacker to gain unauthorized access to sensitive data or disrupt the service of the application.\n\n## Mitigation Advice\n\nTo mitigate this vulnerability, it is recommended to upgrade the `form-data` package to versions 2.5.4, 3.0.4, or 4.0.4 where the vulnerability has been resolved. \n\n## Source Code Fix Recommendation\n\nTo fix the vulnerability in the source code, you should update the `form-data` package in your `package.json` file:\n\n```json\n\"form-data\": {\n  \"version\": \"4.0.4\",\n  \"resolved\": \"https://registry.npmjs.org/form-data/-/form-data-4.0.4.tgz\",\n  \"integrity\": \"sha512-ETEklSGi5t0QMZuiXoA/Q6vcnxcLQP5vdugSpuAyi6SVGi2clPPp+xgEhuMaHC+zGgn31Kd235W35f7Hykkaww==\",\n  \"requires\": {\n    \"asynckit\": \"^0.4.0\",\n    \"combined-stream\": \"^1.0.8\",\n    \"mime-types\": \"^2.1.12\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Library Dependencies\n\nThe code example requires the following library dependencies to execute properly:\n\n- `asynckit`: \"^0.4.0\"\n- `combined-stream`: \"^1.0.8\"\n- `mime-types`: \"^2.1.12\"\n\n## References\n\n- [OWASP Top 10](https://owasp.org/www-project-top-ten/)\n- [Common Weakness Enumeration (CWE)](https://cwe.mitre.org/)\n\nPlease note that the links provided are valid and active for anonymous users at the time of writing this report."
              },
              "properties": {
                "cwe": [],
                "severity": "HIGH",
                "kind": "FAIL"
