            {
              "id": "e0f61038-0a25-3366-84dd-69f72718351c",
              "name": "\"High Severity Vulnerability in Braces Package Version 3.0.2, Resolved in Version 3.0.3 (CVE-2024-4068)\"",
              "helpUri": "https://www.glog.ai/",
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "## Description\n\nThe Braces package version 3.0.2 in Docker programming language has a high severity vulnerability (CVE-2024-4068). This vulnerability allows attackers to execute arbitrary code due to improper input validation. This is a security concern as it can lead to unauthorized access, data corruption, and potential system compromise.\n\n## Mitigation Advice\n\nTo mitigate this vulnerability, it is recommended to upgrade the Braces package to version 3.0.3 or later. This version has resolved the vulnerability and provides improved security.\n\n## Source Code Fix Recommendation\n\nTo fix the vulnerability in the source code, you need to update the version of the Braces package in your `package.json` file:\n\n```json\n\"braces\": {\n  \"version\": \"3.0.3\",\n  \"resolved\": \"https://registry.npmjs.org/braces/-/braces-3.0.3.tgz\",\n  \"integrity\": \"sha512-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\",\n  \"requires\": {\n    \"fill-range\": \"^7.0.1\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nPlease replace the `xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx` with the correct SHA512 checksum for the 3.0.3 version.\n\n## Dependencies\n\nThe code example requires the following library dependencies to execute properly:\n\n- Braces package version 3.0.3 or later\n- Fill-range package version 7.0.1 or later\n\n## References\n\n- [OWASP Top 10 Security Risks](https://owasp.org/www-project-top-ten/)\n- [Common Weakness Enumeration (CWE)](https://cwe.mitre.org/)\n- [CVE-2024-4068](https://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2024-4068)\n\nPlease note that the links provided are active and accessible to anonymous users at the time of writing this report."
              },
              "properties": {
                "cwe": [],
                "severity": "HIGH",
                "kind": "FAIL"
              }
