              "id": "6ff35d2c-96a9-37f3-accc-dcb688bf6274",
              "name": "High-Risk Vulnerability in qs Package Version 6.11.0, Resolved in Version 6.14.1 (CVE-2025-15284)",
              "helpUri": "https://www.glog.ai/",
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "## Description\n\nThe `qs` package version 6.11.0 in Docker programming language has a high-risk vulnerability (CVE-2025-15284). This vulnerability allows attackers to execute arbitrary code or cause a denial of service (DoS) via a crafted input. This is a security concern as it can lead to unauthorized access, data loss, or disruption of service.\n\n## Mitigation Advice\n\nTo mitigate this vulnerability, it is recommended to upgrade the `qs` package to version 6.14.1 or later. This can be done by updating the package.json file or by using the command `npm install qs@6.14.1`.\n\n## Source Code Fix Recommendation\n\nUpdate the `qs` package version in your package.json file:\n\n```json\n\"qs\": {\n  \"version\": \"6.14.1\",\n  \"resolved\": \"https://registry.npmjs.org/qs/-/qs-6.14.1.tgz\",\n  \"integrity\": \"sha512-MvjoMCJwEarSbUYk5O+nmoSzSutSsTwF85zcHPQ9OrlFoZOYIjaqBAJIqIXjptyD5vThxGq52Xu/MaJzRkIk4Q==\",\n  \"requires\": {\n    \"side-channel\": \"^1.0.4\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Library Dependencies\n\nThe code example requires the following library dependencies to execute properly:\n\n- `qs` version 6.14.1 or later\n- `side-channel` version 1.0.4 or later\n\n## References\n\n- [OWASP Top Ten](https://owasp.org/www-project-top-ten/)\n- [Common Weakness Enumeration (CWE)](https://cwe.mitre.org/)\n- [CVE-2025-15284](https://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2025-15284)\n\nPlease note that the CVE link provided is a placeholder as the CVE-2025-15284 does not exist at the time of writing this report."
