              "id": "6e6e65e8-a70e-3752-99aa-90cc25f3ebde",
              "name": "\"High-Risk Vulnerability in JSON Web Token Package, Resolved in Version 9.0.0 (CVE-2022-23539)\"",
              "helpUri": "https://www.glog.ai/",
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "## Description\n\nThe vulnerability CVE-2022-23539 is a high-risk vulnerability found in the JSON Web Token (JWT) package used in Docker programming language. This vulnerability is present in versions prior to 9.0.0. The vulnerability allows an attacker to bypass authentication or forge tokens, leading to unauthorized access to sensitive information or systems.\n\n## Security Concern\n\nThis vulnerability is a security concern because it can lead to unauthorized access to systems or data. An attacker could exploit this vulnerability to bypass authentication mechanisms, forge tokens, and gain access to sensitive information. This could lead to data breaches, unauthorized actions on the system, and other security incidents.\n\n## Mitigation Advice\n\nTo mitigate this vulnerability, it is recommended to upgrade the `jsonwebtoken` package to version 9.0.0 or later. This version contains a fix for the vulnerability. \n\n## Source Code Fix Recommendation\n\nTo fix the vulnerability in the source code, you should update the version of `jsonwebtoken` in your `package.json` file:\n\n```json\n\"jsonwebtoken\": \"^9.0.0\",\n```\n\nThen, run `npm install` to install the updated package.\n\n## Dependencies\n\nThe code example requires the following library dependencies to execute properly:\n\n- jws: ^3.2.2\n- lodash.includes: ^4.3.0\n- lodash.isboolean: ^3.0.3\n- lodash.isinteger: ^4.0.4\n- lodash.isnumber: ^3.0.3\n- lodash.isplainobject: ^4.0.6\n- lodash.isstring: ^4.0.1\n- lodash.once: ^4.0.0\n- ms: ^2.1.1\n- semver: ^5.6.0\n\n## References\n\n- [OWASP JWT Cheat Sheet](https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/JSON_Web_Token_Cheat_Sheet_for_Java.html)\n- [CWE-347: Improper Verification of Cryptographic Signature](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/347.html)"
              },
              "properties": {
                "cwe": [
                  {
                    "id": "CWE-347",
                    "url": "https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/347.html"
                  }
                ],
                "severity": "HIGH",
                "kind": "FAIL",
                "tags": [
                  "CWE-347"
                ]
              }
